# Pstack Engineering Rules

1. Every claim made in audits and outreach copy must be backed by verifiable proof (e.g. response time, SSL status, DOM selectors).
2. Never simulate or mock live outputs in production pipelines.
3. Every test suite must execute against concrete inputs with reproducible verification commands.
